msgid "procfs"
msgstr "procfs"

msgid ""
"procfs 由内核生成，通过 VFS 挂载在 ``/proc``；不需要用户态守护进程。 文件描述已有内核对象和策略。未实现的 Linux 子系统不会因为增加一个同名文件 而获得相应功能。"
msgstr ""
"procfs is generated by the kernel and mounted at ``/proc`` through VFS; no userspace daemon is "
"needed. Its files describe existing kernel objects and policies. Adding a file with a Linux "
"subsystem's name does not implement that subsystem."

msgid "系统视图"
msgstr "System Views"

msgid "路径"
msgstr "Path"

msgid "内容与边界"
msgstr "Contents and Boundaries"

msgid "``loadavg``"
msgstr "``loadavg``"

msgid "调度器的 1/5/15 分钟 Q16 负载、可运行/存活任务数、最近分配的 PID。"
msgstr ""
"Scheduler Q16 load averages over 1/5/15 minutes, runnable/live task counts, and the most recently "
"allocated PID."

msgid "``stat``"
msgstr "``stat``"

msgid "总计及每 CPU 的 user/system/idle、外部中断总数、上下文切换、启动时间、 创建任务数和当前可运行任务数。"
msgstr ""
"Aggregate and per-CPU user/system/idle time, total external interrupts, context switches, boot "
"time, tasks created, and currently runnable tasks."

msgid "``meminfo``"
msgstr "``meminfo``"

msgid "物理内存总量/空闲量、页缓存、tmpfs、Dirty 和已启用 swap 容量。 ``MemAvailable`` 扣除应急保留并计入可证明能回收的缓存，不包含 swap。"
msgstr ""
"Total/free physical memory, page cache, tmpfs, Dirty, and enabled swap capacity. ``MemAvailable`` "
"subtracts the emergency reserve and includes provably reclaimable cache, excluding swap."

msgid "``vmstat``"
msgstr "``vmstat``"

msgid "空闲/缓存/tmpfs 页数、实际物理页分配/释放、逻辑用户 fault、换入/换出、 direct/background 回收及 OOM kill 信号发布计数。"
msgstr ""
"Free/cache/tmpfs page counts, actual physical page allocations/frees, logical user faults, swap-"
"ins/outs, direct/background reclaim, and OOM kill signal publications."

msgid "``swaps``"
msgstr "``swaps``"

msgid ""
"已发布 swap 文件/分区的保留路径、KiB 容量/使用量及优先级，包含正在 drain 的区域；每次打开捕获固定视图。激活条件见 :doc:`../admin-guide/swap`。"
msgstr ""
"Retained paths, capacity/usage in KiB, and priorities for published swap files/partitions, "
"including draining areas; each open captures a fixed view. See :doc:`../admin-guide/swap` for "
"activation requirements."

msgid "``partitions``"
msgstr "``partitions``"

msgid "当前注册整盘、GPT/MBR 分区和光驱的设备号、KiB 容量及设备名称。"
msgstr ""
"Device numbers, capacity in KiB, and device names for currently registered whole disks, GPT/MBR "
"partitions, and optical drives."

msgid "``diskstats``"
msgstr "``diskstats``"

msgid "整盘和光驱的实际块传输统计，采用 Linux 原始的 11 个统计字段。"
msgstr ""
"Actual block transfer statistics for whole disks and optical drives, using the original 11 Linux "
"statistics fields."

msgid "``interrupts``"
msgstr "``interrupts``"

msgid "每 CPU 实际收到的非零外部中断向量；不输出处理函数地址。"
msgstr ""
"External interrupt vectors with nonzero actual receipt counts per CPU; handler addresses are not "
"printed."

msgid "``net/dev``"
msgstr "``net/dev``"

msgid "核心网卡服务观察到的收发字节/包/错误，以及本地 UDP 的 loopback 统计。"
msgstr ""
"Transmit/receive bytes, packets, and errors observed by the core network device service, plus "
"local UDP loopback statistics."

msgid "``net/route``、``net/arp``"
msgstr "``net/route``, ``net/arp``"

msgid "loopback、已配置直连子网/默认网关，以及现存 ARP 缓存；读取不发起探测。"
msgstr ""
"Loopback, configured directly connected subnets/default gateways, and the existing ARP cache; "
"reads initiate no probes."

msgid "``net/tcp``、``net/udp``、``net/unix``"
msgstr "``net/tcp``, ``net/udp``, ``net/unix``"

msgid "现有端点、协议状态、实际队列、所有者和数值 inode；UNIX 地址支持抽象名。"
msgstr ""
"Existing endpoints, protocol states, actual queues, owners, and numeric inodes; UNIX addresses "
"support abstract names."

msgid ""
"CPU 时间以 100 Hz 调度 tick 结算，在 syscall、用户页错误和返回用户态的边界 区分 user/system。它不是高精度的 IRQ、softirq 或 iowait "
"计时；尚无独立记账的 CPU 列为零。当前阻塞任务均为可中断等待，``procs_blocked`` 不将它们冒充为 Linux 的 D 状态。任务和创建计数包含线程。"
msgstr ""
"CPU time is accounted in 100 Hz scheduler ticks, distinguishing user/system at syscall, user page-"
"fault, and return-to-userspace boundaries. This is not high-resolution IRQ, softirq, or iowait "
"timing; CPU columns without separate accounting are zero. Current blocked tasks all use "
"interruptible waits; ``procs_blocked`` does not present them as Linux D-state tasks. Task and "
"creation counts include threads."

msgid ""
"``diskstats`` 的扇区单位始终为 512 字节，包括 2048 字节块的光驱。 成功完成的传输才增加读写次数和扇区数；错误不算成功，``EAGAIN`` 重试不重复 "
"累计成功传输。进行中请求、读写耗时、忙碌毫秒及加权毫秒来自真实请求生命周期； 取消会移除进行中请求。没有请求合并层，合并计数为零；没有分区、discard 或 flush "
"的独立统计行/扩展字段。同步统计不分配内存；异步记账记录分配失败时 不改变 I/O 返回值，但该请求的等待时间无法完整保留。 ``partitions`` 解析未缓存的分区表时可能进行元数据 "
"I/O，并返回真实传输错误。"
msgstr ""
"``diskstats`` always uses 512-byte sectors, including optical drives with 2048-byte blocks. Only "
"successfully completed transfers increase read/write and sector counts; errors are not successes, "
"and ``EAGAIN`` retries do not double-count successful transfers. In-flight requests, read/write "
"times, busy milliseconds, and weighted milliseconds come from actual request lifecycles; "
"cancellation removes an in-flight request. There is no request merging layer, so merge counts are "
"zero. There are no separate partition rows or discard/flush extension fields. Synchronous "
"accounting allocates no memory. Failure to allocate an asynchronous accounting record does not "
"change the I/O result, but that request's wait time cannot be fully retained. ``partitions`` may "
"perform metadata I/O when parsing an uncached partition table and returns actual transfer errors."

msgid "进程与线程"
msgstr "Processes and Threads"

msgid ""
"``/proc/self`` 指向调用者 TGID，``/proc/thread-self`` 指向 ``TGID/task/TID``。根目录枚举线程组首领；存活线程也可直接通过 "
"``/proc/TID`` 访问。``/proc/PID/task`` 仅枚举该线程组，拒绝外组 TID、数字溢出以及递归 ``task/TID/task``。显式线程视图不再列出 "
"``task`` 子目录。"
msgstr ""
"``/proc/self`` points to the caller's TGID, and ``/proc/thread-self`` to ``TGID/task/TID``. The "
"root directory enumerates thread-group leaders; live threads are also directly accessible as "
"``/proc/TID``. ``/proc/PID/task`` enumerates only that thread group and rejects foreign TIDs, "
"numeric overflow, and recursive ``task/TID/task``. Explicit thread views do not list a ``task`` "
"subdirectory."

msgid "下面的叶节点同样适用于 ``/proc/PID/task/TID`` 和 ``/proc/thread-self``："
msgstr "The following leaf nodes also apply to ``/proc/PID/task/TID`` and ``/proc/thread-self``:"

msgid "叶节点"
msgstr "Leaf Node"

msgid "内容"
msgstr "Contents"

msgid "``status``"
msgstr "``status``"

msgid "名称、状态、四组 UID/GID、补充组、umask、虚拟/RSS/代码/数据/栈/锁定内存、 线程数、信号掩码、capability、NoNewPrivs 和 CPU 亲和性。"
msgstr ""
"Name, state, four UID/GID sets, supplementary groups, umask, virtual/RSS/code/data/stack/locked "
"memory, thread count, signal masks, capabilities, NoNewPrivs, and CPU affinity."

msgid "Linux 顺序的 52 个字段；user/system tick 分开，进程视图汇总存活组成员， 显式线程视图只读一个线程；保留原有敏感地址字段的权限过滤。"
msgstr ""
"52 fields in Linux order, with separate user/system ticks. Process views aggregate live group "
"members, while explicit thread views read one thread; existing permission filtering of sensitive "
"address fields is retained."

msgid "``statm``"
msgstr "``statm``"

msgid "以 4096 字节页为单位的虚拟量、RSS、共享映射、代码与数据/栈。"
msgstr "Virtual size, RSS, shared mappings, code, and data/stack in units of 4096-byte pages."

msgid "``maps``"
msgstr "``maps``"

msgid "按地址排序的 VMA、权限、完整文件偏移、实际设备号/inode，以及持有对象的 当前路径或 deleted 后缀；匿名区域标注 heap/stack/vDSO/vvar。"
msgstr ""
"Address-sorted VMAs, permissions, full file offsets, actual device numbers/inodes, and current "
"paths of retained objects or a deleted suffix; anonymous regions are labeled heap/stack/vDSO/vvar."

msgid "``smaps``、``smaps_rollup``"
msgstr "``smaps``, ``smaps_rollup``"

msgid "逐区域或汇总的 RSS/PSS、共享/私有 clean/dirty、Referenced、Anonymous、 Locked；swap 和未支持的匿名大页统计为零。"
msgstr ""
"Per-region or aggregate RSS/PSS, shared/private clean/dirty, Referenced, Anonymous, and Locked; "
"swap and unsupported anonymous huge-page statistics are zero."

msgid "``limits``"
msgstr "``limits``"

msgid "内核支持的八项资源限制：文件数、地址空间、待处理信号、栈、进程数、 core 大小、锁定内存和普通文件大小；不虚构其他 rlimit。"
msgstr ""
"The eight resource limits supported by the kernel: file count, address space, pending signals, "
"stack, process count, core size, locked memory, and regular file size. No other rlimits are "
"fabricated."

msgid "``auxv``"
msgstr "``auxv``"

msgid "exec 构造的二进制 ``uint64_t type, value`` 数组，包括 ``AT_NULL``； 不是文本，也不重新读取可能被用户修改的栈。"
msgstr ""
"The binary ``uint64_t type, value`` array built by exec, including ``AT_NULL``; not text, and not "
"reread from a stack that users may have modified."

msgid "``io``"
msgstr "``io``"

msgid "已终结的 read/pread/readv/preadv/preadv2 及对应 write 调用数、成功字符数， 以及调用上下文中成功块传输的字节数。"
msgstr ""
"Completed read/pread/readv/preadv/preadv2 and corresponding write call counts, successful "
"character counts, and bytes from successful block transfers in the calling context."

msgid "``fdinfo/FD``"
msgstr "``fdinfo/FD``"

msgid ""
"共享 OFD 的位置、用户可见打开标志、该描述符的 CLOEXEC、mount ID/inode， 以及 eventfd/timerfd/epoll 的专项元数据；读取不消费事件或推进定时器。"
msgstr ""
"Shared OFD position, user-visible open flags, the descriptor's CLOEXEC, mount ID/inode, and "
"eventfd/timerfd/epoll-specific metadata; reading consumes no events and advances no timers."

msgid ""
"PSS 通过遍历实际用户 PTE，按物理页的用户映射数分摊；共享同一地址空间的 ``CLONE_VM`` 线程只统计一次，缓存引用和内核引用不增加分母。设备映射不计入 "
"普通驻留页。Dirty/Referenced 来自页表标志。读取 smaps 需要扫描各地址空间， 并为映射计数分配临时存储，可能返回 ``ENOMEM``。"
msgstr ""
"PSS walks actual user PTEs and apportions physical pages by user mapping count. ``CLONE_VM`` "
"threads sharing an address space count once; cache and kernel references do not increase the "
"denominator. Device mappings are excluded from ordinary resident pages. Dirty/Referenced comes "
"from page-table flags. Reading smaps scans address spaces and allocates temporary mapping-count "
"storage, so it may return ``ENOMEM``."

msgid ""
"进程 ``io`` 汇总存活组成员，显式线程路径只显示相应线程。阻塞重试不会重复 计为用户调用；终结错误计为一次调用但不增加字符数。当前不包含 send/recv、 sendfile 等全部 "
"Linux I/O 记账，也不保留已回收线程的历史组内累计值。 ``cancelled_write_bytes`` 为零，因为当前没有延迟脏页写回抵消记账。"
msgstr ""
"Process ``io`` aggregates live group members; explicit thread paths show only that thread. "
"Blocking retries do not double-count user calls; a final error counts as one call but adds no "
"characters. This does not yet cover all Linux I/O accounting such as send/recv or sendfile, nor "
"preserve historical group totals for reaped threads. ``cancelled_write_bytes`` is zero because "
"deferred dirty-page writeback cancellation accounting is absent."

msgid "网络表、socket ``fdinfo``、``fd`` 链接及 ``fstat`` 使用一致的数值 inode。 这些标识来自对象序号/句柄，不是内核指针，也不保证跨启动稳定。"
msgstr ""
"Network tables, socket ``fdinfo``, ``fd`` links, and ``fstat`` use consistent numeric inodes. "
"These identifiers derive from object sequences/handles, not kernel pointers, and are not "
"guaranteed stable across boots."

msgid "权限与读取语义"
msgstr "Permissions and Read Semantics"

msgid ""
"``maps``、``smaps``、``smaps_rollup``、``auxv``、``io`` 和 ``fdinfo`` 复用 现有的 proc "
"FSCREDS/dumpable/``CAP_SYS_PTRACE`` 检查。仅 UID 0 不构成绕过。 PID inode 保留任务身份令牌，PID 被复用后不会自动指向新任务。"
msgstr ""
"``maps``, ``smaps``, ``smaps_rollup``, ``auxv``, ``io``, and ``fdinfo`` reuse existing proc "
"FSCREDS/dumpable/``CAP_SYS_PTRACE`` checks. UID 0 alone grants no bypass. PID inodes retain task "
"identity tokens and do not automatically refer to new tasks after PID reuse."

msgid ""
"新增文本文件及二进制 auxv 在成功打开时完整生成一份 OFD 快照；权限也在该时点 检查。随后短读、seek、EOF 均基于这份快照，进程退出或数据变化不拼接两代输出。 dup "
"共享已打开的视图，重新打开会生成新视图。快照不采用固定 4 KiB 截断； 分配失败返回 ``ENOMEM``。这与 Linux 各 proc 文件的实时/seq_file 行为存在差异。 原有 "
"``cmdline``、``environ``、mount view 和诊断文件仍遵守各自既有读取规则。 ``/proc/sys/fs/inotify`` "
"下的控制值在读取时取当前策略，不使用打开时快照。"
msgstr ""
"New text files and binary auxv generate a complete OFD snapshot on successful open, checking "
"permissions then as well. Subsequent short reads, seeks, and EOF use that snapshot, without "
"splicing two generations after process exit or data changes. dup shares the open view; reopening "
"creates a new one. Snapshots are not truncated at a fixed 4 KiB; allocation failure returns "
"``ENOMEM``. This differs from Linux proc files' live/seq_file behavior. Existing ``cmdline``, "
"``environ``, mount views, and diagnostic files retain their respective read rules. Controls under "
"``/proc/sys/fs/inotify`` read the current policy rather than an open-time snapshot."

msgid "策略节点"
msgstr "Policy Nodes"

msgid "以下节点是现行内核策略的只读快照，不支持通过写文件调整："
msgstr ""
"The following nodes are read-only snapshots of current kernel policies and cannot be adjusted by "
"writing files:"

msgid "``/proc/sys/kernel/pid_max``：非零 32 位 PID 命名空间上限。"
msgstr "``/proc/sys/kernel/pid_max``: upper bound of the nonzero 32-bit PID namespace."

msgid "``/proc/sys/fs/nr_open``：描述符实现上限。"
msgstr "``/proc/sys/fs/nr_open``: descriptor implementation limit."

msgid ""
"``/proc/sys/fs/file-nr``：实际已分配 OFD、零个闲置预分配 OFD、全局上限。 dup/fork 别名不重复计数，排队、映射或进行中 I/O 保留的 OFD "
"直到最终释放才减计数。"
msgstr ""
"``/proc/sys/fs/file-nr``: actual allocated OFDs, zero unused preallocated OFDs, and the global "
"limit. dup/fork aliases are not counted twice; OFDs retained by queues, mappings, or in-flight I/O"
" count until final release."

msgid "``/proc/sys/fs/file-max``：没有额外全局 OFD 数量配额，以 ``UINT64_MAX`` 表示； 仍受内存和每进程 rlimit 限制。"
msgstr ""
"``/proc/sys/fs/file-max``: no additional global OFD quota, represented by ``UINT64_MAX``; memory "
"and per-process rlimits still apply."

msgid ""
"``/proc/sys/fs/pipe-max-size``、``pipe-user-pages-soft``、``pipe-user-pages-hard``： "
"来自管道实现的现行容量、软限制及零值的未设置硬限制。"
msgstr ""
"``/proc/sys/fs/pipe-max-size``, ``pipe-user-pages-soft``, ``pipe-user-pages-hard``: current "
"capacity and soft limit from the pipe implementation, with zero indicating an unset hard limit."

msgid ""
"``/proc/sys/fs/inotify/{max_user_instances,max_user_watches,max_queued_events}`` 是可写策略，root "
"可调整实例、监听和新队列的容量，普通用户只读。 默认值、超限错误及事件丢失恢复见 :doc:`inotify`。"
msgstr ""
"``/proc/sys/fs/inotify/{max_user_instances,max_user_watches,max_queued_events}`` are writable "
"policies: root can adjust instance, watch, and new-queue capacity, while ordinary users can only "
"read. See :doc:`inotify` for defaults, over-limit errors, and event-loss recovery."

msgid "验证入口"
msgstr "Validation Entry Points"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_procfs.py`` 在 ASan/UBSan 下运行真实 proc/VFS 和 fdinfo 实现，覆盖 "
"枚举、线程成员关系、权限、PSS、auxv、长快照、seek/EOF 与分配失败。 CPU、块设备、UDP/TCP/UNIX 和描述符生命周期由各自宿主测试覆盖。 "
"``tools/tests/procfs_probe.c`` 可在原生 Linux 上作为 ABI 参考运行，也可由操作系统 使用其 SDK 编译后放入 ReliefNT 来宾执行；Linux "
"参考通过不能视为来宾验收。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_procfs.py`` runs actual proc/VFS and fdinfo implementations under ASan/UBSan, "
"covering enumeration, thread membership, permissions, PSS, auxv, long snapshots, seek/EOF, and "
"allocation failures. CPU, block device, UDP/TCP/UNIX, and descriptor lifecycles have separate host"
" tests. ``tools/tests/procfs_probe.c`` can run on native Linux as an ABI reference, or be built by"
" the OS with its SDK for a ReliefNT guest. Passing the Linux reference does not constitute guest "
"acceptance."

msgid ""
"``tools/tests/procfs_raw_probe.c`` 是无需 libc 的 x86-64 syscall 探针，编译参数 见文件头。它可作为小型 initramfs 的 "
"``/init``，通过 ``rdinit=/init`` 启动， 在串口输出节点短读、seek/EOF、maps/PSS、auxv、线程目录、克隆后的 ``thread-"
"self``、fdinfo 和真实 UDP 接收队列的验收结果。作为 PID 1 时，探针 输出结果后等待，不退出触发内核 panic。相同源码也由宿主 ``procfs`` 套件在 Linux "
"上运行；队列检查兼容 Linux 缓冲区占用与 ReliefNT 有效载荷字节的差异。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/tests/procfs_raw_probe.c`` is an x86-64 syscall probe requiring no libc; build flags are "
"in its header. It can serve as ``/init`` in a small initramfs, booted with ``rdinit=/init``, and "
"prints serial acceptance results for short node reads, seek/EOF, maps/PSS, auxv, thread "
"directories, cloned ``thread-self``, fdinfo, and real UDP receive queues. As PID 1 it waits after "
"printing results rather than exiting and triggering kernel panic. The host ``procfs`` suite runs "
"the same source on Linux; queue checks accommodate Linux buffer occupancy versus ReliefNT payload-"
"byte differences."
